@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Payment Policy — SAT Jewel";
}

<div class="sat-legal-page-wrap">
    <!-- Header Banner -->
    <div class="sat-legal-banner">
        <div class="sat-legal-banner-inner">
            <span class="sat-legal-badge">Store Policies</span>
            <h1 class="sat-legal-title">Payment Policy</h1>
            <p class="sat-legal-subtitle">Comprehensive guide to accepted payment options, security standards, financing, deposits, and order processing at Sat Jewels.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="sat-legal-container">

        <!-- 1. Accepted Payment Options -->
        <div class="sat-legal-card">
            <h2 class="sat-legal-heading"><i class="fa-solid fa-credit-card gold-icon"></i> 1. Accepted Payment Options</h2>
            <p>At Sat Jewels, we offer a variety of secure and convenient payment methods to ensure a smooth checkout experience for our global customers. We accept:</p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Credit & Debit Cards:</strong> Visa, MasterCard, American Express, Discover, and JCB.</li>
                <li><strong>Online Payment Gateways:</strong> PayPal and Razorpay.</li>
                <li><strong>Digital Wallets & Express Checkout:</strong> Apple Pay, Google Pay, and Shop Pay.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- 2. Payment Security & Encryption -->
        <div class="sat-legal-card">
            <h2 class="sat-legal-heading"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved gold-icon"></i> 2. Payment Security & Encryption</h2>
            <p>Your security is our top priority. All financial transactions on our platform are processed using advanced 256-bit SSL encryption. Sat Jewels complies strictly with Payment Card Industry Data Security Standards (PCI-DSS). We never store or retain your sensitive card information on our servers.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- 3. Currency & Pricing -->
        <div class="sat-legal-card">
            <h2 class="sat-legal-heading"><i class="fa-solid fa-dollar-sign gold-icon"></i> 3. Currency & Pricing</h2>
            <p>All prices listed on our website are displayed in USD ($) by default for international convenience.</p>
            <p>For orders processed in other currencies, your issuing bank or card provider will handle the conversion based on their daily exchange rates and applicable transaction fees.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- 4. Payment Authorization & Order Processing -->
        <div class="sat-legal-card">
            <h2 class="sat-legal-heading"><i class="fa-solid fa-clock-rotate-left gold-icon"></i> 4. Payment Authorization & Order Processing</h2>
            <p>Orders will be confirmed and sent to production only after full payment authorization is received. If a payment fails or is flagged as fraudulent by our automated verification systems, the order will be placed on hold until verified by our support team.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- 5. Flexible Financing & Direct Layaway / Split Plan -->
        <div class="sat-legal-card">
            <h2 class="sat-legal-heading"><i class="fa-solid fa-calculator gold-icon"></i> 5. Flexible Financing & Payment Plans</h2>
            <p>We provide flexible financing alternatives so you can pay for your jewelry over time:</p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Instant Installments (Shop Pay, Klarna, Afterpay):</strong> You can break your order into 4 interest-free payments using Shop Pay, Klarna, or Afterpay. Extended monthly financing options are also available through Klarna and Afterpay depending on your selection. When using these services, your order is processed and shipped immediately upon approval.</li>
                <li><strong>Sat Jewels Direct Layaway / Split Plan:</strong> If you prefer to deal directly with us, Sat Jewels offers an in-house split-payment option. You can secure your piece with a 30% initial deposit and divide the remaining balance into 3 to 4 flexible installments. Please note that for our direct Sat Jewels split plan, your completed jewelry will be dispatched as soon as the total balance is fully paid off.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- 6. Partial Deposits & Balance Payment -->
        <div class="sat-legal-card">
            <h2 class="sat-legal-heading"><i class="fa-solid fa-coins gold-icon"></i> 6. Partial Deposits Prior to Shipping</h2>
            <p>Sat Jewels allows you to initiate your order with an upfront deposit of just 30%. Our artisans will start crafting your jewelry right away, and you can pay the remaining balance once your piece is completely finished and ready for dispatch. Please contact our support team, and we will gladly help you set up this partial payment link.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- 7. Order Cancellation Policy -->
        <div class="sat-legal-card">
            <h2 class="sat-legal-heading"><i class="fa-solid fa-ban gold-icon"></i> 7. Order Cancellation Policy</h2>
            <p>If you wish to cancel your order, please contact the Sat Jewels support team within 48 hours of purchase for a full refund. Any cancellation request submitted after this initial 48-hour window will incur a 40% cancellation fee to cover the custom manufacturing and material allocation costs already incurred.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- 8. Taxes & Import Duties -->
        <div class="sat-legal-card">
            <h2 class="sat-legal-heading"><i class="fa-solid fa-earth-americas gold-icon"></i> 8. Taxes & Import Duties (USA & International Orders)</h2>
            <p>Customs fees, import duties, and local taxes may apply depending on your destination country. These charges are the responsibility of the customer and are not included at checkout unless specified.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Contact Box -->
        <div class="sat-legal-card contact-card">
            <h2 class="sat-legal-heading"><i class="fa-solid fa-envelope gold-icon"></i> Have Questions About Payment?</h2>
            <p>For any payment-related inquiries or assistance with failed transactions, please reach out directly to our team:</p>
            <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:satjewels31@gmail.com">satjewels31@gmail.com</a></p>
            <p><strong>Phone / WhatsApp:</strong> +91 76987 27798</p>
        </div>

    </div>
</div>

<style>
    .sat-legal-page-wrap {
        background: #000000;
        color: #ffffff;
        min-height: 100vh;
        padding-bottom: 80px;
        font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
    }
    .sat-legal-banner {
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(212, 178, 112, 0.15) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 100%);
        padding: 80px 24px 40px;
        text-align: center;
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(212, 178, 112, 0.2);
    }
    .sat-legal-banner-inner {
        max-width: 800px;
        margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .sat-legal-badge {
        display: inline-block;
        background: rgba(212, 178, 112, 0.15);
        color: #D4B270;
        padding: 6px 18px;
        border-radius: 20px;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(212, 178, 112, 0.3);
    }
    .sat-legal-title {
        font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
        font-size: 3rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #ffffff;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .sat-legal-subtitle {
        color: #cccccc;
        font-size: 1.15rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .sat-legal-container {
        max-width: 1000px;
        margin: 40px auto 0;
        padding: 0 24px;
    }
    .sat-legal-card {
        background: #0d0d0d;
        border: 1px solid rgba(212, 178, 112, 0.2);
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 36px;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
        box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
    }
    .sat-legal-heading {
        font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        color: #D4B270;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
    }
    .gold-icon {
        color: #D4B270;
    }
    .sat-legal-card p {
        color: #d1d5db;
        line-height: 1.8;
        font-size: 1.02rem;
        margin-bottom: 14px;
    }
    .sat-legal-card p:last-child {
        margin-bottom: 0;
    }
    .sat-legal-card ul {
        margin: 12px 0 16px 24px;
        color: #d1d5db;
    }
    .sat-legal-card li {
        margin-bottom: 10px;
        line-height: 1.7;
    }
    .contact-card {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #141414 0%, #0a0a0a 100%);
        border-color: rgba(212, 178, 112, 0.4);
    }
    .contact-card a {
        color: #D4B270;
        text-decoration: underline;
    }
</style>
